            "divide the chores", "split the chores", "divide chores", "dividing the chores",
            "split the housework", "share the housework", "sharing the housework",
            "who should do what", "around the house", "household jobs",
            "jobs around the house", "who does what", "fair share", "mental load",
            # "how do i get my husband to help more" was a search hedge while this row sat
