                 "being mean", "is mean", "was mean", "being rude", "is rude", "was rude",
                 "being nasty", "is nasty", "was nasty", "being unkind", "is unkind",
                 "was unkind", "rude friend", "mean friend", "nasty friend", "unkind friend",
