                 "nasty comments", "mean comments", "snide", "put me down", "puts me down",
                 "laughed at me", "made fun of me", "hurt my feelings",
                 # a friend whose company is exhausting is not a how-to-meet-people question:
                 # "my friend is draining me how do i distance myself" was sent "pick one regular
